(# HKMA/Basel III Regulatory Framework Test Document) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Capital Requirements Framework) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Hong Kong Monetary Authority \(HKMA\) implements the Basel III regulatory framework) Tj
T*
(for capital adequacy standards.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Key Components:) Tj
T*
(1. **Minimum Capital Requirements**) Tj
T*
(   - Common Equity Tier 1 \(CET1\): Minimum 4.5% of risk-weighted assets) Tj
T*
(   - Tier 1 Capital: Minimum 6.0% of risk-weighted assets) Tj
T*
(   - Total Capital: Minimum 8.0% of risk-weighted assets) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. **Capital Conservation Buffer**) Tj
T*
(   - 2.5% of risk-weighted assets) Tj
T*
(   - Must be met with CET1 capital) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. **Countercyclical Capital Buffer**) Tj
T*
(   - Range: 0% to 2.5% of risk-weighted assets) Tj
T*
(   - HKMA may adjust based on credit cycle) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. **Leverage Ratio**) Tj
T*
(   - Minimum 3.0% for all banks) Tj
T*
(   - Tier 1 capital to total exposures) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## HKMA Implementation Guidelines) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Local Implementation) Tj
T*
(- **Scope**: All authorized institutions in Hong Kong) Tj
T*
(- **Timeline**: Phased implementation completed in 2019) Tj
T*
(- **Supervision**: Regular stress testing and supervisory review) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Additional Requirements) Tj
T*
(- **Higher Loss Absorbency \(HLA\)** for domestic systemically important banks \(D-SIBs\)) Tj
T*
(- **Loss Absorbing Capacity \(LAC\)** requirements for resolution planning) Tj
T*
(- **Net Stable Funding Ratio \(NSFR\)** requirements) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Compliance Monitoring) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Reporting Requirements) Tj
T*
(- Monthly regulatory returns \(MA\(BS\)1\)) Tj
T*
(- Quarterly capital adequacy returns) Tj
T*
(- Annual stress testing results) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Enforcement Actions) Tj
T*
(- Capital add-ons for non-compliance) Tj
T*
(- Restrictions on dividends and bonuses) Tj
T*
(- Supervisory actions for persistent deficiencies) Tj
ET
